# Planner overrides, loaded after ArduPilot's copter.parm.
# Placeholder battery: the stock SITL quad draws about 35 A, so 3300 mAh
# (the default) is empty after about 6 minutes, before a long fairway is done.
# 12000 mAh is about 20 minutes, the same placeholder endurance as the
# built-in sim (sim.ENDURANCE_S). Replace with the real pack later.
BATT_CAPACITY 12000

# Downward rangefinder like the airframe's TFmini-S (0.1 to 12 m), simulated
# by SITL (TYPE 100) so the dashboard's rangefinder panel has data. On the real
# drone it is RNGFND1_TYPE 20 (Benewake TFmini serial) on a SERIALn port set
# to protocol 9. Copter 4.6 still takes these limits in centimeters.
RNGFND1_TYPE 100
RNGFND1_MIN_CM 10
RNGFND1_MAX_CM 1200
RNGFND1_ORIENT 25
